Map the dyld shared cache under cider: skip code-signature registration (aarch64 #11 A).

The guest dyld opened the installed cache but rejected it silently. Cause: mapCachePrivate
registers the cache's code signature via fcntl(F_ADDFILESIGS_RETURN); under cider (which does
not enforce code signatures) that returns -1, so dyld set errorMessage and fell back to loading
each dylib individually. The upstream halt-on-error in mapSharedCache is commented out, so the
reject was invisible. Skip the CS registration + coverage check for the cache under DARLING, and
log sSharedCacheLoadInfo.errorMessage when the cache is not used so any further reject reason is
visible.

Signed-off-by: Niclas Overby <niclas@overby.me>
---
--- a/dyld3/SharedCacheRuntime.cpp
+++ b/dyld3/SharedCacheRuntime.cpp
@@ -460,6 +460,7 @@
         return false;
     }
 
+#ifndef DARLING  // cider #11 A: cider does not enforce code signatures; skip cache CS registration
     // register code signature of cache file
     fsignatures_t siginfo;
     siginfo.fs_file_start = 0;  // cache always starts at beginning of file
@@ -479,6 +480,7 @@
         ::close(fd);
         return false;
     }
+#endif // !DARLING
     void* mappedData = ::mmap(NULL, sizeof(firstPage), PROT_READ|PROT_EXEC, MAP_PRIVATE, fd, 0);
     if ( mappedData == MAP_FAILED ) {
         results->errorMessage = "first page of shared cache not mmap()able";
--- a/src/dyld2.cpp
+++ b/src/dyld2.cpp
@@ -4239,6 +4239,10 @@
 		dyld::gProcessInfo->sharedCacheBaseAddress          = (unsigned long)sSharedCacheLoadInfo.loadAddress;
 		sSharedCacheLoadInfo.loadAddress->getUUID(dyld::gProcessInfo->sharedCacheUUID);
 		dyld3::kdebug_trace_dyld_image(DBG_DYLD_UUID_SHARED_CACHE_A, sSharedCacheLoadInfo.path, (const uuid_t *)&dyld::gProcessInfo->sharedCacheUUID[0], {0,0}, {{ 0, 0 }}, (const mach_header *)sSharedCacheLoadInfo.loadAddress);
+	}
+	// cider #11 A: surface why the shared cache was not used (upstream halt path is disabled).
+	else if ( sSharedCacheLoadInfo.errorMessage != nullptr ) {
+		dyld::log("dyld: shared cache not used: %s\n", sSharedCacheLoadInfo.errorMessage);
 	}
 
 //#if TARGET_OS_IPHONE && !TARGET_OS_SIMULATOR
